<title>USA: ROSS needs immediate cash infusion.</title>
<headline>ROSS needs immediate cash infusion.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ROSS Technology Inc said on Thursday that it requires an immediate infusion of cash in order to meet its current obligations and continue operations, as a result of its operating losses, inventory write-down and account receivable reserves.</p>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd will respond to the request by February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>In the third quarter, ROSS, a majority-owned subsidiary of Fujitsu received an additional credit facility guaranteed by Fujitsu. Sun Microsystems Inc holds a minority position in ROSS.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
